@startuml Activity_Diagram

title Tensor Decomposer - Pure Vertical Activity Diagram

start
:Enter Tensor Data & Select Action\n(Decompose / Visualize / Benchmark / Compare);
if (Input Valid?) then (Yes)
    :Display Loader & Send AJAX Request;
    :Parse Tensor Input\n(JSON / AST / Flat Number Tokens);
    :Execute Selected Algorithm & Analytics\n(CP, Tucker, HOSVD, TT, SVD, QR, LU, Eigen);
    :Return JSON Response & Export Artifact\n(Saved to results/ Directory);
    :Hide Loader & Render UI Output Panel\n(Factors / SVG Heatmaps / Metrics / Comparison);
    :Inspect Results & Interact with Output\n(View Factors, Download JSON, Scrub 3D Slice);
    stop
else (No)
    :Show Error Notification;
    stop
endif

@enduml
